{
  "segments": [
    {
      "text": "Slingshot 的输入起点是 n×J 的归一化表达矩阵，因此 normalized_expression=present 满足这一输入条件。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "quote": "We start from an n×J matrix of normalized expression measures (e.g., read counts) for n single cells and J genes or features."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "降维不是 Slingshot 的硬性必要条件，原文明确允许直接使用归一化表达，但强烈推荐先降维。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "quote": "Although Slingshot can in principle be applied directly to the normalized expression measures, we strongly recommend a dimensionality reduction step before pseudotemporal reconstruction"
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "你提供 reduced_dimensions=present，因此已满足这一推荐条件。",
      "basis": "USER_PROVIDED_FACT",
      "citations": [],
      "context_fact_ids": [
        "user:reduced_dimensions"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Slingshot 假设细胞已被划分为 K 个簇，但这一假设不能自动转换为执行阻断条件。",
      "basis": "CAUTION_CONTEXT",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "quote": "Slingshot assumes that the n cells have been partitioned into K clusters, potentially corresponding to distinct cellular states."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "你提供 cluster_labels=absent，因此当前缺少簇划分信息；这会影响 Slingshot 基于簇的 MST 阶段，但不应被当作硬性执行门槛。",
      "basis": "USER_PROVIDED_FACT",
      "citations": [],
      "context_fact_ids": [
        "user:cluster_labels"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "已知末端簇只提供可选的局部监督，不会固定所有谱系的数量。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 3,
          "quote": "Known terminal clusters provide optional local supervision; they do not fix the number of all lineages."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Slingshot 能为每个谱系分配 pseudotime，因此具备完成你所述 pseudotime 推断任务的能力。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 5,
          "quote": "Slingshot assigns per-lineage pseudotime to cells."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    }
  ],
  "clarification": null
}
